Tue Oct 27 12:51:42 UTC 2026 - drahn76@gmail.com

- Update to 0.1.10:
  * Web pages Kit opens (OAuth sign-in for providers and remote MCP
    servers) are shown in a panel above the terminal with the full,
    unwrapped URL, copy and Open buttons, instead of Kit trying to
    start a browser on the server.
  * Sign-ins that redirect to a "localhost" callback can be finished
    by pasting the browser's final address into that panel; Cockpit
    delivers it to Kit on the server.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Oct 20 07:59:55 UTC 2026 - drahn76@gmail.com

- Update to 0.1.9:
  * Terminal: text selected with the mouse in Kit's TUI is now copied
    to the browser clipboard (Kit copies via OSC 52, which the
    terminal now supports). Shift+drag (Option+drag on macOS) gives a
    native terminal selection instead.

